#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:3
#: c21b38833091431ba1ddd914ea112d30
msgid "Bain 路径（Bain Path）"
msgstr "Bain Path"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:5
#: c0447b439bd84abb983925f26f46e347
msgid "**分类：** 晶格"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:7
#: bb6f343777884bdf9e0b372e493ad99d
msgid "功能说明"
msgstr "What the card does"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:9
#: 2caf3672da3a42e0a11626c1a7f089f8
msgid ""
"沿一个指定晶轴做四方畸变，生成一组不同 `c/a` 比的晶胞。它保留原子数和元素组"
"成，只改变晶格矢量，可用于给 bcc/fcc/fct 转变、四方相变路径、近似马氏体变形等"
"场景补训练结构。"
msgstr ""
"Apply a tetragonal distortion along a selected cell axis to generate cells "
"with different `c/a` ratios. The operation preserves atom count and "
"composition and changes only the lattice vectors. Use it to sample bcc/fcc/"
"fct transformations, tetragonal transition paths, and approximate "
"martensitic deformations."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:11
#: d624ef054cd941cfa25c1e9284525ec7
msgid ""
"这张卡不是随机扰动卡。它扫描的是晶胞形状自由度：选定 `x`、`y` 或 `z` 作为 c "
"轴，按 `c/a 范围`（`ca_range`）改变该方向长度；`constant_volume` 会同步缩放另"
"外两条轴让体积保持不变，`scale_volume` 会在此基础上再扫体积，`free_c` 只改选"
"中轴。"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:13
#: 7eb3a9d1ac144b9683875fb649791cc7
msgid "原理与公式"
msgstr "Principle and equations"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:15
#: 7644d28361d64ec99e3d8148d2a22382
msgid ""
"设扫描因子为 $r=c/a$，选中的 c 轴写在矩阵最后一维。三种模式对应的形变矩阵为"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:17
#: 6faa349be4654d2885b6a4fa29011019
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\mathbf D_{\\mathrm{等体积}}=\n"
"\\operatorname{diag}(r^{-1/2},r^{-1/2},r),\\qquad\n"
"\\mathbf D_{\\mathrm{自由c轴}}=\\operatorname{diag}(1,1,r).\n"
msgstr ""
"\nThis section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result.\n"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:23
#: 9d352fbb78a949fbbfb00cb8c09c389a
msgid ""
"等体积模式满足 $\\det\\mathbf D_{\\mathrm{等体积}}=1$。`形状加体积`模式再给整"
"个晶胞乘 $v^{1/3}$，即 $\\mathbf C'=v^{1/3}\\mathbf D_{\\mathrm{等体积}}"
"\\mathbf C$，所以 $V'/V=v$。选择 x 或 y 轴时只需相应置换对角元。`缩放原子坐标"
"`开启时保持分数坐标不变， 原子随晶胞一起变形；关闭时保持 Cartesian 坐标不变。"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:28
#: 75858b4209cd4c5e912be172cd43bede
msgid "操作示例"
msgstr "Example workflow"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:30
#: 57f2cf780f0c492a8114f9fd2e8009b2
msgid "场景：模型在 bcc 到 fct 变形路径上能量曲线不平滑"
msgstr "Scenario: A jagged energy curve along a bcc-to-fct path"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:32
#: f30b9f0e136c474fb676bbc2bdce1f9d
msgid ""
"你的 NEP 模型在 bcc Fe 的平衡结构附近力误差很低，但沿 Bain 路径拉伸时能量曲线"
"出现不合理的尖峰。训练集中有平衡 bcc 和少量随机应变，却缺少系统的四方畸变结"
"构，模型只能把这条相变路径当外推。"
msgstr ""
"A NEP model has low force error near equilibrium bcc Fe, but its energy "
"curve develops unphysical spikes along the Bain path. The training set "
"contains equilibrium bcc and a few random strains but no systematic "
"tetragonal distortions, leaving the transition path as extrapolation."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:34
#: cfca6d7bf8b04a11910c30149e85fd8d
msgid "**输入：** 一个弛豫后的 bcc 或近 bcc 超胞。"
msgstr "**Input:** A relaxed bcc or near-bcc supercell."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:36
#: 0f63433565ee41c89b2ba8317fbad619
msgid ""
"**目标：** 在保持体积近似不变的前提下扫描 `c/a = 0.8, 1.0, 1.2`，让模型见过从"
"压扁到拉长的晶胞形状。"
msgstr ""
"**Objective:** Scan `c/a = 0.8, 1.0, 1.2` at approximately constant volume "
"so the model sees both oblate and elongated cells."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:38
#: 4ec8b0befd3341f4b5306b99a51e2e7e
msgid "**参数设置：**"
msgstr "**Parameters:**"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:39
#: c00aa126758e44d99229f09ac98a9525
msgid "`轴`选择 `z`；"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:40
#: 49ac83b7f26f440fb3b2d1310758cde3
msgid "`c/a 范围`填 `[0.8, 1.2, 0.2]`；"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:41
#: 2bd30c4d59564dc48ce491b0d991648d
msgid "`模式`选择“保持体积”；"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:42
#: 2055c634bdfb4023a5ce0d8682caebdd
msgid "开启`缩放原子坐标`。"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:44
#: 6a9331e374ae4b2fbf2e01ec06f54ec9
msgid ""
"**输出：** 3 个结构，带 `Bain(ax=z,ca=...,V=...,mode=constant_volume)` 标签。"
msgstr ""
"**Output:** Three structures labeled "
"`Bain(ax=z,ca=...,V=...,mode=constant_volume)`."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:46
#: ddbd3f1373ab4c76b7054d427a067521
msgid ""
"**怎么验证训练集质量改善：** 重训后重新扫同一 Bain 路径，能量曲线应更平滑，峰"
"值位置不应随采样点轻微移动而大幅跳变。如果仍然不稳，缩小步长到 0.05 或在 "
"`scale_volume` 模式下给每个 `c/a` 加入 0.95、1.00、1.05 三个体积点。"
msgstr ""
"**How to verify the improvement:** After retraining, rescan the same Bain "
"path. The energy curve should be smoother and peak positions should not jump "
"after small changes in sampling points. If it remains unstable, reduce the "
"step to 0.05 or use `scale_volume` to add volume ratios 0.95, 1.00, and 1.05 "
"at every `c/a`."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:48
#: 2074d4bd2bbf45b1826f0ea6480c949b
msgid "参数说明"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:50
#: 52ed31c6a6684a759b44a2157b5587b1
msgid "轴（axis）"
msgstr "axis"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:52
#: c07b1e0201f94546aa65d832c43fc51f
msgid "`str`，默认 `\"z\"`。指定哪条晶格矢量当作 Bain 路径里的 c 轴。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default `\"z\"`. Selects the lattice vector used as the c axis of the "
"Bain path."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:54
#: 1006f94b61324ab4b223acef324d91fd
msgid ""
"选 `z` 最常见，因为很多输入结构已经把相变或薄膜方向放在第三条晶格矢量。若你的"
"候选畸变方向实际沿 x 或 y，直接切换即可；不要先手动换轴再跑卡片，那样更容易把"
"后续标签和结构方向搞混。"
msgstr ""
"`z` is common because many inputs place the transition or film direction "
"along the third lattice vector. Choose `x` or `y` directly when appropriate. "
"Avoid manually permuting axes first, which makes later labels easier to "
"misinterpret."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:0
#: affd8f78bd4b454eb8a407e82d7aad4d 4928b029ce1f470dbc8859783fa9f3cf
msgid "选项"
msgstr "Options"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:0
#: 04453a0781c14821804646a3a1a80969 98ae037ad1914e3c8a7be1124dce52c0
msgid "含义"
msgstr "Meaning"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:0
#: 15f1632c40bb448b8d77cdced6884987 e708336c815644f192b3957338f4f78d
msgid "什么时候选"
msgstr "When to choose it"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:0
#: 250b3fff21cf40039141df5fa617b167
msgid "`x`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:0
#: 064bf7b38d51478c98236e727afe2a8c
msgid "缩放第一条晶格矢量"
msgstr "Scale the first lattice vector"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:0
#: 50cbbbc456f047dfad50f188fe391014
msgid "变形方向沿 a 轴"
msgstr "Distort along the a axis"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:0
#: ed878328292b4f5fa15b718cdb5573b4
msgid "`y`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:0
#: de28349cac5a41a29c4b186640572827
msgid "缩放第二条晶格矢量"
msgstr "Scale the second lattice vector"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:0
#: c612a2af9e9142c4abec425ad21595d6
msgid "变形方向沿 b 轴"
msgstr "Distort along the b axis"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:0
#: e97f5690fb204b9c8f96a5ba2c9b2bcf
msgid "`z`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:0
#: b31982b8bf3e47cd87ea46b8214b0fac
msgid "缩放第三条晶格矢量"
msgstr "Scale the third lattice vector"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:0
#: 9a70ad5fb61c4716953d56bcef64ed6d
msgid "变形方向沿 c 轴，默认选择"
msgstr "Distort along the c axis; the default"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:62
#: d8a9bff152554497a6fca146957d09f1
msgid "c/a 范围（ca_range）"
msgstr "ca_range"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:64
#: a235790b70be4661a1cc90340cbc2e27
msgid ""
"`tuple[float, float, float]`，默认 `(1.0, 1.0, 1.0)`。格式是 `[起点, 终点, 步"
"长]`，扫描选中轴的相对缩放因子。"
msgstr ""
"`tuple[float, float, float]`, default `(1.0, 1.0, 1.0)`. A `[start, stop, "
"step]` scan of the relative scale factor for the selected axis."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:66
#: b880203ccaf14bbf9f5f88da25f7fd23
msgid ""
"`1.0` 表示原始晶胞；`0.9` 是选中轴压短 10%；`1.1` 是拉长 10%。如果只是补近平"
"衡响应，`0.95-1.05` 通常够用；研究 bcc/fcc/fct 路径时可以扩到 `0.7-1.4`，但每"
"批输出都要检查最近邻距离和体积是否仍在你愿意做 DFT 的范围内。"
msgstr ""
"`1.0` keeps the original cell, `0.9` shortens the selected axis by 10%, and "
"`1.1` lengthens it by 10%. For near-equilibrium response, `0.95-1.05` is "
"usually sufficient. A bcc/fcc/fct study may extend to `0.7-1.4`, but check "
"nearest-neighbor distances and volumes in every batch before committing DFT "
"resources."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:68
#: 9edb9c0df0b144e696d58165af98187b
msgid "模式（mode）"
msgstr "mode"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:70
#: b525ba4fc5a04dd7b954ac2643b38eca
msgid ""
"`str`，默认 `\"constant_volume\"`。决定选中轴变化时，另外两条轴和总体积怎么处"
"理。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default `\"constant_volume\"`. Controls how the other two axes and "
"total volume respond when the selected axis changes."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:0
#: 68c775f986134b5c8c498ea17efbda5d
msgid "`constant_volume`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:0
#: 7f9611b4be1049e1934f56d2078972c6
msgid "选中轴乘以 `r`，另外两轴乘以 `1/sqrt(r)`"
msgstr "Multiply the selected axis by `r` and the other two by `1/sqrt(r)`"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:0
#: edbd5e6841d84df3a3700ffd902f83c8
msgid "想隔离形状效应，不想把体积变化混进去"
msgstr "Isolate shape effects without introducing volume changes"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:0
#: f4609ca362ae4d64be2d967ed6fe130c
msgid "`scale_volume`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:0
#: 8dd7bd98a3ea4f20a1533b2a4510d29c
msgid ""
"先做 constant-volume Bain，再按 `体积缩放范围`（`volume_scale_range`）统一缩"
"放体积"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:0
#: c3d375e8307e4a68b2d6922fa1f19830
msgid "同时补四方畸变和体积响应"
msgstr "Cover tetragonal distortion and volume response together"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:0
#: 95e3f9e1c7aa4475817a4c0b01647c92
msgid "`free_c`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:0
#: b9d9e9709abe460a97f0db7c9fddcc31
msgid "只缩放选中轴，另外两轴不动"
msgstr "Scale only the selected axis"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:0
#: 44f0e51b29d74c0fb418e52d265597bc
msgid "模拟外延约束或单轴加载"
msgstr "Approximate epitaxial constraints or uniaxial loading"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:78
#: fa3b3aefd49b4df98ae9a2e0142b10c0
msgid "体积缩放范围（volume_scale_range）"
msgstr "volume_scale_range"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:80
#: e267ee8adf1641dda9d1f365ee497e3e
msgid ""
"`tuple[float, float, float]`，默认 `(1.0, 1.0, 1.0)`。格式是 `[起点, 终点, 步"
"长]`，表示输出体积相对原始体积的比例。"
msgstr ""
"`tuple[float, float, float]`, default `(1.0, 1.0, 1.0)`. A `[start, stop, "
"step]` scan of output volume relative to the original volume."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:82
#: 44168e83e9b142e3beae33069755a3ed
msgid ""
"这个参数只在 `mode = \"scale_volume\"` 时生效。比如 `[0.95, 1.05, 0.05]` 会为"
"每个 `c/a` 生成 0.95、1.00、1.05 三个体积点；如果 `c/a 范围`（`ca_range`）有 "
"5 个点，总输出就是 15 个结构。范围别一上来开太大，体积和形状同时扫很容易把训"
"练集放大。"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:84
#: be65f44c6fa34831a4637fb1b17c9df8
msgid "生效条件：`模式`（`mode`）必须是 `scale_volume`。"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:86
#: 96551fb75b8a403d99e62e9a71121951
msgid "缩放原子坐标（scale_atoms）"
msgstr "scale_atoms"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:88
#: 2840f5b6303c466ab2be5a7101389407
msgid ""
"`bool`，默认 `true`。打开后原子随晶胞一起按分数坐标缩放；关闭后保留 "
"Cartesian 坐标，只改 cell。"
msgstr ""
"`bool`, default `true`. When enabled, atoms follow the cell at fixed "
"fractional coordinates. When disabled, Cartesian coordinates remain fixed "
"while only the cell changes."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:90
#: 0c8feabab9c946678d2dee4848aa33df
msgid ""
"训练集构型生成通常应保持打开，因为这代表结构整体经历晶格畸变。关闭更像是在改"
"周期边界而不是改内部结构，适合少数外延盒子或调试场景；关掉后务必检查原子是否"
"贴近边界或产生异常近邻。"
msgstr ""
"Keep this enabled for normal training-set generation so the entire structure "
"undergoes the lattice distortion. Disabling it changes periodic boundaries "
"more than internal geometry and is appropriate only for special epitaxial-"
"box or debugging cases. Inspect boundary proximity and nearest neighbors "
"afterward."

