#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:150
#: 305c14f6618a4493859583e005220a5a
msgid ""
"`Bain Path` → `Atomic Perturb`：先补系统四方畸变，再给每个形变点加入小坐标扰"
"动，覆盖非零温局域环境。"
msgstr ""
"`Bain Path` -> `Atomic Perturb`: sample systematic tetragonal distortions, "
"then add small coordinate perturbations at each point for finite-temperature "
"local environments."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:151
#: da05ed37b12e4a1a9b07d82d057ba0db
msgid ""
"`Super Cell` → `Bain Path`：先扩胞再扫路径，避免小胞里单个缺陷或磁序周期过"
"短。"
msgstr ""
"`Super Cell` -> `Bain Path`: expand first so a defect or magnetic period is "
"not artificially confined by a small cell."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:152
#: 231186d8bfb74c10b6f593bcafc27788
msgid ""
"`Bain Path` → `Lattice Strain`：先覆盖相变主路径，再补普通轴向应变，用来稳定"
"弹性响应。"
msgstr ""
"`Bain Path` -> `Lattice Strain`: cover the main transition path, then add "
"ordinary axial strains to stabilize elastic response."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:154
#: 1588a86996914c12878499b6248e924d
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "Common questions"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:156
#: 7ae509608ad64d638df01dfa3246b16c
msgid ""
"**输出结构数比预期多。** `scale_volume` 会对每个 `c/a` 再乘上每个体积点；总数"
"是两组扫描点数的乘积。"
msgstr ""
"**More structures than expected.** `scale_volume` combines every `c/a` with "
"every volume point; the total is the product of both scan sizes."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:158
#: 220dab46d4b64ed2b0bbff7a8db6b867
msgid ""
"**体积没有保持不变。** 检查 `模式`（`mode`）是否为 `constant_volume`。"
"`free_c` 会改变体积，`scale_volume` 会按 `体积缩放范围`"
"（`volume_scale_range`）继续改体积。"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:160
#: f14e25881dab435ca2778c015aaed630
msgid ""
"**结构看起来被拉得太夸张。** 缩小 `c/a 范围`（`ca_range`），先用 `0.95-1.05` "
"验证模型响应，再决定是否覆盖更宽相变路径。"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:162
#: 4c49654367f5422b91f1ab06d49b5ed7
